<!DOCTYPE html><html> <head>  <meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8" />  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initialscale=1.0" />  <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge" />  <style type="text/css">@media screen and (max-width: 480px) {slot[style] {margin-right: 0 !important;}.columnDiv {margin-right: 0 !important;}}@media screen and (min-width: 480px) {slot[style] {margin-bottom: 0 !important;}.columnDiv {margin-bottom: 0 !important;}}</style>  <style type="text/css">@media screen and (max-width: 480px) {.contentbuilderBaseColumnRow .columnCell {display:inline-block;width:100%}}</style>  <style type="text/css">.contentpageDefaultEmailTemplatePageTemplate .contentRoot {width: 600px;}@media only screen and (max-width: 480px) {.contentpageDefaultEmailTemplatePageTemplate .contentRoot {width: 320px;}}</style> </head> <body>  <table class="contentpageDefaultEmailTemplatePageTemplate" style="background-color: #FFFFFF;" role="presentation" id="contentpage_emailTemplateBodyContent" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">       <tr>     <td width="100%" align="center">      <table class="contentRoot" style="background-color: #FFFFFF;" role="presentation" width="600" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">               <tr>         <td style="padding-top: 10px; padding-bottom: 10px; padding-left: 10px; padding-right: 10px;">          <table class="contentbuilderBaseColumnRow" style="align-items: flex-start; width: 100%; background-color:#5B5B5B;" role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">                       <tr valign="top">             <td width="100%" class="columnCell" style="vertical-align: top;display: inline-block; float:left">              <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; word-break:break-word;">                               <tr>                 <td>                  <table style="width:100%; border-collapse: collapse; word-break:break-word;" id="contentRegion" role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" locked="0">                                       <tr>                     <td align="Center"><img src="https://business-connect-2067--dev.sandbox.my.salesforce.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159O00000IEfDp&amp;oid=00D9O00000JrJj8" alt="" width="600" style="width: 100%; display: block; border: none; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain; height: 80px;" /></td>                    </tr>                                     </table></td>                </tr>                             </table></td>            </tr>                     </table>          <table class="contentbuilderBaseColumnRow" style="align-items: flex-start; width: 100%; background-color:#FFFFFF;" role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">                       <tr valign="top">             <td width="100%" class="columnCell" style="vertical-align: top;display: inline-block; float:left">              <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; word-break:break-word;">                               <tr>                 <td>                  <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; word-break: break-word; font-size: 14px" id="contentRegion" role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" locked="0">                                       <tr>                     <td style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;padding-top: 20px;padding-right: 20px;padding-bottom: 20px;padding-left: 20px;">Liebe/r Geschäftspartner/in,<br /><br /> du möchtest dich für unseren Außer-Haus Webshop von J.J.Darboven registrieren – vielen Dank für dein Interesse.<br /><br /> Bitte klicke auf die folgende Schaltfläche, um deine Darboven-Registrierung abzuschließen:<br /><br /><a href="placeholder" style="background-color:orange;border:12px solid orange;border-radius:5px;          color:#000000;display:inline-block;font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;          font-size:14px;line-height:14px;text-decoration:none;text-align:center;">Ja, das ist meine E-Mail-Adresse. </a><br /><br /> Wir schicken an deine E-Mail-Adresse einen Link für den Außer-Haus Webshop. Dies kann bis zu 24 Stunden dauern. Bitte überprüfe auch deinen Spam-Ordner.<br /><br /> Bei Fragen stehen wir dir sehr gerne zur Verfügung unter <a href="mailto:ecommerce@darboven.com">ecommerce@darboven.com</a>.<br /><br /> Mit freundlichen Grüßen,<br /> Ihre Ipek Göc<br /> und das Darboven Webshop-Team</td>                    </tr>                                     </table></td>                </tr>                             </table></td>            </tr>                     </table>          <table class="contentbuilderBaseColumnRow" style="align-items: flex-start; width: 100%; background-color:#5B5B5B;" role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">                       <tr valign="top">             <td width="100%" class="columnCell" style="vertical-align: top;display: inline-block; float:left">              <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; word-break:break-word;">                               <tr>                 <td>                  <table style="font-size:14px; width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; word-break: break-word;" role="presentation" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" id="contentregion" locked="0">                                       <tr>                     <td class="contentbuilder-html" style="padding: 0;">&nbsp;</td>                    </tr>                                     </table></td>                </tr>                             </table></td>            </tr>                     </table></td>        </tr>             </table></td>    </tr>     </table> </body></html>